  "notes": [
    "BLACK UNDER THE WHITE. Every founder is E/E a/a, a black horse, and every one carries dominant white, so what you see is white. The white is W2 (and W9), because those whiten the whole horse from a single copy; W22 in this mod is a minimal white - a blaze and socks on a black horse - and was tried first and rejected on a render. W2/W2 and W9/W9 do not survive to birth, so the white is held two ways (owner's call, 2026-09-30): 70 in 100 are W2/N, and 30 in 100 carry two different whites, W2/W9, which is viable. Two W2/N unicorns throw a black foal one time in four; a W2/W9 bred to anything throws only white foals.",
    "The horn is all four horn genes at once: Horn/Horn for the horn, Glw/Glw so it glows, Dst/Dst so it sheds dust, and a random colour. Three in four founders have a solid horn, spread evenly over all twelve colours; one in four is already two-tone, spread evenly over every pair.",
    "Rainbow dust is the one thing only some of them have: a quarter show it (Rbw/Rbw) and another quarter carry it silently (Rbw/n), so it can be bred up.",
    "Glowing hooves (Lthf/Lthf), a prismtail mane and tail (Prt/Prt) and a love of sugar (Sug/Sug) are on every founder, homozygous so the breed keeps them.",
    "Carries neither tolerance locus, so a unicorn is neutral to heat and cold everywhere."
  ]
